++    // Cross-NODE all-reduce via a NCCL/RCCL "world" communicator (GGML_META_WORLD_ALLREDUCE=1).
++    // Each backend executes an IN-PLACE GGML_OP_ALLREDUCE on its shard as its own world rank:
++    // backend 0 (local CUDA) is rank 0, backend 1 (an ggml-rpc peer) is rank 1. Both graphs are
++    // dispatched with the non-blocking async path (CUDA stream / fire-and-forget RPC) so the ranks
